ing Off\nL52: \nL53: (5)\nL54: باب مَنْ أَشْرَكَ فِي عَمَلِهِ غَيْرَ اللَّهِ\nL55: \nL56: Sahih Muslim 2985\nL57: \nL58: Abu Huraira reported Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) as stating that Allah the Most High and Exalted said:\nL59: \nL60: I am the One, One Who does not stand in need of a partner. If anyone does anything in which he associates anyone else with Me, I shall abandon him with one whom he associates with Allah.\nL61: حَدَّثَنِي cite10†زُهَيْرُ بْنُ حَرْبٍ ، حَدَّثَنَا cite11†إِسْمَاعِيلُ بْنُ إِبْرَاهِيمَ ، أَخْبَرَنَا cite12†رَوْحُ بْنُ الْقَاسِمِ ، عَنِ cite13†الْعَلاَءِ بْنِ عَبْدِ الرَّحْمَنِ بْنِ يَعْقُوبَ ، عَنْ cite14†أَبِيهِ ، عَنْ cite15†أَبِي هُرَيْرَةَ ، قَالَ قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏\"‏ قَالَ اللَّهُ تَبَارَكَ وَتَعَالَى أَنَا أَغْنَى الشُّرَكَاءِ عَنِ الشِّرْكِ مَنْ عَمِلَ عَمَلاً أَشْرَكَ فِيهِ مَعِي غَيْرِي تَرَكْتُهُ وَشِرْكَهُ ‏\"‏ ‏.‏\nL62: Reference  |  : cite16†Sahih Muslim 2985 L63: In-book reference  |  : Book 55, Hadith 58\nL64: USC-MSA web (English) reference  |  : Book 42, Hadith 7114\nL65:   (deprecated numbering scheme)\nL66: \nL67: Report Error | Share | Copy ▼\nL68: \nL69: cite17†2984b cite18†2986 L70: \nL71: cite19†About | cite20†News | cite21†Support | cite22†Developers | cite23†Contact | cite0†Donate L72: \nL73: Hadith Text [Input]Arabic [Input]Translation [Input]Grade Reference [Input]Concise [Input]Detailed [Input]URL\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSahih Muslim 622 - The Book of Mosques and Places of Prayer - كتاب الْمَسَاجِدِ وَمَوَاضِعِ الصَّلاَةِ - Sunnah.com - Sayings and Teachings of Prophet Muhammad (صلى الله عليه و سلم) (https://sunnah.com/muslim%3A622)\nciteturn52view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://sunnah.com/muslim:622\",\"lineno\":null}); Redirected to URL: https://sunnah.com/muslim:622; Total lines: 73\nL0: Contribute to our mission cite0†Do