nL63: \nL64: Sahih al-Bukhari 6007\nL65: \nL66: Narrated Abu Huraira:\nL67: \nL68: Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, \"The one who looks after and works for a widow and for a poor person is like a warrior fighting for Allah's Cause.\" (The narrator Al-Qa'nabi is not sure whether he also said \"Like the one who prays all the night without slackness and fasts continuously and never breaks his fast.\")\nL69: حَدَّثَنَا cite10†عَبْدُ اللَّهِ بْنُ مَسْلَمَةَ ، حَدَّثَنَا cite11†مَالِكٌ ، عَنْ cite12†ثَوْرِ بْنِ زَيْدٍ ، عَنْ cite13†أَبِي الْغَيْثِ ، عَنْ cite14†أَبِي هُرَيْرَةَ ـ رضى الله عنه ـ قَالَ قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏\"‏ السَّاعِي عَلَى الأَرْمَلَةِ وَالْمِسْكِينِ كَالْمُجَاهِدِ فِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ ـ وَأَحْسِبُهُ قَالَ، يَشُكُّ الْقَعْنَبِيُّ ـ كَالْقَائِمِ لاَ يَفْتُرُ، وَكَالصَّائِمِ لاَ يُفْطِرُ ‏\"‏‏.‏\nL70: Reference  |  : cite15†Sahih al-Bukhari 6007 L71: In-book reference  |  : Book 78, Hadith 38\nL72: USC-MSA web (English) reference  |  : Vol. 8, Book 73, Hadith 36\nL73:   (deprecated numbering scheme)\nL74: \nL75: Report Error | Share | Copy ▼\nL76: \nL77: cite16†6006 cite17†6008 L78: \nL79: cite18†About | cite19†News | cite20†Support | cite21†Developers | cite22†Contact | cite0†Donate L80: \nL81: Hadith Text [Input]Arabic [Input]Translation [Input]Grade Reference [Input]Concise [Input]Detailed [Input]URL\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSunan Abi Dawud 1657 - Zakat (Kitab Al-Zakat) - كتاب الزكاة - Sunnah.com - Sayings and Teachings of Prophet Muhammad (صلى الله عليه و سلم) (https://sunnah.com/abudawud%3A1657)\nciteturn52view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 days ago; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://sunnah.com/abudawud:1657\",\"lineno\":null}); Redirected to URL: https://sunnah.com/abudawud:1657; Total lines: 82\nL0: Contribute to our mission cite0†Donate Now L1: \nL2: cite1†Qur'an†quran.com | cite2†Sunnah | cite3†Pra