َاعُونَ عَلَى عَهْدِ رَسُولِ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم عَارِيَةَ الدَّلْوِ وَالْقِدْرِ ‏.‏\nL69: Grade:  |  Hasan (Al-Albani)  |   حسن   (الألباني)  | حكم   :\nL70: \nL71: Reference  |  : cite15†Sunan Abi Dawud 1657 L72: In-book reference  |  : Book 9, Hadith 102\nL73: English translation  |  : Book 9, Hadith 1653\nL74: \nL75: Report Error | Share | Copy ▼\nL76: \nL77: cite16†1656 cite17†1658 L78: \nL79: cite18†About | cite19†News | cite20†Support | cite21†Developers | cite22†Contact | cite0†Donate L80: \nL81: Hadith Text [Input]Arabic [Input]Translation [Input]Grade Reference [Input]Concise [Input]Detailed [Input]URL\n"
